{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5Gq19XReS116uWVap9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple wooden door, old grain weathered gray by years of rain and sun. My iron hinges groan as I recognize the key.*\n\n*The lock turns.*\n\n*Click.*\n\n*I swing open slowly, revealing what lies beyond: a narrow stone corridor lit by flickering candlelight, the smell of damp earth and old parchment drifting through. Somewhere deeper, the faint sound of dripping water echoes.*\n\n*I am open. You may pass.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":113,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}